      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEUTRON (6) goes very well at this journey having never missed the frame including five wins and two placings. Hit the frame latest (19.86) when second at this track in a Restricted WIN. Makes strong appeal on best. SMOKY CHIPOTLE (2) was game in defeat at the latest run, finishing third and beaten 2 lengths (30.50) behind Ethan's Brother at Q Parklands. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Expected to be in this for a long way. TARCISIA (8) hit the ground running from a squeeze draw and was prominent throughout but faded out of it when 6th at Q Straight in a Grade 5. Can do much better this time. COOL GENT (7) should be thereabouts.",
